@title Crane in 3D: Use my crane model swaps the hook and the hoist for the parts of a STEP file
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768
# A synthetic crane of named boxes (qa/fixtures/crane-model, made by make_fixture.py). The picker reads it, the hook block and
# hook become one piece under the rope and the drum, gearbox and motor one piece on the trolley; the girder is counted as not used.
open qa/fixtures/travel-drive.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 120
shot generic-crane
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/crane-model/test-crane-parts.stp
click_text "Use my crane model..."
wait 60
expect "5 of 6 parts used"
shot own-model-in-the-picture
click 673 174
wait 150
shot own-model-hook-framed
click_text "Remove model"
wait 20
shot generic-again
check_layout
